      "messages": {
        "202300000": {
          "id": 202300000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "세상에 이렇게 귀여운 생명체가 있다니",
          "next": [
            202300001
          ]
        },
        "202300001": {
          "id": 202300001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "말랑말랑한 발바닥에선 갓 지은 밥 냄새가 나",
          "next": [
            202300002
          ]
        },
        "202300002": {
          "id": 202300002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "아쉽게도 내 카메라가 고장 나서 천사 같은 강아지 사진을 찍을 수가 없네",
          "next": [
            202300003,
            202300004,
            202300006
          ]
        },
        "202300003": {
          "id": 202300003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "동의해요! 강아지가 세계를 구한다!",
          "next": [
            202300008
          ]
        },
        "202300004": {
          "id": 202300004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "강아지 키우세요? 저도 만져볼래요",
          "next": [
            202300005
          ]
        },
        "202300005": {
          "id": 202300005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "안타깝게도 의뢰인의 강아지야",
          "next": [
            202300008
          ]
        },
        "202300006": {
          "id": 202300006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "죄송하지만 전 고양이파예요",
          "next": [
            202300007
          ]
        },
        "202300007": {
          "id": 202300007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "오, 그렇군",
          "next": [
            202300008
          ]
        },
        "202300008": {
          "id": 202300008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "신분을 밝힐 수 없는 중요한 인물이 오늘 아침 출처 불명의 협박 편지를 받았어",
          "next": [
            202300009
          ]
        },
        "202300009": {
          "id": 202300009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "편지엔 겨우 한 마디만 적혀 있었지——「개자식, 죽여버리겠다」",
          "next": [
            202300010
          ]
        },
        "202300010": {
          "id": 202300010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "난 조금도 망설이지 않고 의뢰를 받아들였어",
          "next": [
            202300011
          ]
        },
        "202300011": {
          "id": 202300011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "이제는 누구도 감히 강아지의 털끝 하나 못 건드릴걸",
          "next": [
            202300012
          ]
        },
        "202300012": {
          "id": 202300012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "그 개가 진짜 개를 뜻하지 않는 걸 수도 있잖아요?",
          "next": [
            202300013
          ]
        },
        "202300013": {
          "id": 202300013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "아, 의뢰인 말이야? 당연히 알지. 걱정 마, 내레이터군이 그 사람을 보호하러 갔으니까",
          "next": [
            202300014
          ]
        },
        "202300014": {
          "id": 202300014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "의뢰인보다 날 더 필요로 하는 건 강아지야",
          "next": [
            202300015,
            202300016
          ]
        },
        "202300015": {
          "id": 202300015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "누가 봐도 애쉬베일 씨가 강아지를 더 필요로 하는 것 같은데요",
          "next": [
            202300017
          ]
        },
        "202300016": {
          "id": 202300016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "차라리 한 마리 키우는 게 어때요? 남의 집 강아지만 물고 빨지 말고요",
          "next": [
            202300017
          ]
        },
        "202300017": {
          "id": 202300017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "후!!! 사료 살 돈만 있다면 내가 직접 키웠지",
          "next": [
            202300018
          ]
        },
        "202300018": {
          "id": 202300018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "의뢰인이 그러는데 강아지는 돈 먹는 하마래…. 나 때문에 강아지를 고생시킬 순 없지",
          "next": [
            202300019
          ]
        },
        "202300019": {
          "id": 202300019,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "next": [
            202300020
          ]
        },
        "202300020": {
          "id": 202300020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "잠깐, 뭔가 이상한데",
          "next": [
            202300021
          ]
        },
        "202300021": {
          "id": 202300021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "상대방이 입력 중입니다",
          "next": [
            202300022
          ]
        },
        "202300022": {
          "id": 202300022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "착하지, 내 지갑 물지 마. 돈 없다고. 강아지는 아무거나 먹으면 안 돼. 멍멍멍멍!",
          "next": [
            202300023
          ]
        },
        "202300023": {
          "id": 202300023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "음성 메시지가 변환되었습니다",
          "next": [
            202300024
          ]
        },
        "202300024": {
          "id": 202300024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "왜 이렇게 험한 욕을 해? 멍멍멍! 들었어? 강아지는 욕하면 안 돼. 멍멍멍멍!",
          "next": [
            202300025
          ]
        },
        "202300025": {
          "id": 202300025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "음성 메시지가 변환되었습니다",
          "next": [
            202300026
          ]
        },
        "202300026": {
          "id": 202300026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "멍멍멍, 내 돈, 멍멍멍! 멍멍멍멍!",
          "next": [
            202300027
          ]
        },
        "202300027": {
          "id": 202300027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "음성 메시지가 변환되었습니다",
          "next": [
            202300028
          ]
        },
        "202300028": {
          "id": 202300028,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "강아지는, 멍멍멍, 하면 안 돼! 멍멍멍멍멍멍!",
